+
+# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- MD|187: 90s hip-hop, 96 BPM
+# slots: 0 BOOMBP (the dusty break), 1 DRUMS (one-shots: kick, kick 2, snare, rim, hat, open hat, shaker,
+# clap), 2 STABS (Dm9, Gm9, horns, horns 2, strings, strings A7b9, organ, Rhodes low), 3 VOX (HEY, YO, UH,
+# HO, AHH, YEAH, HUH, scratch)
